{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>דבאך</b> — from the root דאבה, inverted letter order, like כשבים / כבשים — a complete word. And these are the days of old age, in which a person wastes away (דואב); that is, even in the time of their old age they have strength, by means of luxuries, and anointing with oil sustains them. As the master said: the warmth and oil with which my mother anointed me in my childhood stood by me in my old age."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:30.673150638Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}